# team-merge — the nine branches, measured as one tree

`merge/read-path` at `4902866` (records follow in the next commit), base
`main@7e3d2e6`. All nine team branches are merged; see `MERGE.md` for the
conflict resolutions and the two documented opt-in limitations.

## Commands

Build the measured image:

    flock /tmp/fpq-bench.lock -c 'docker build -q --target dev -t fpq-merged -f docker/Dockerfile .'

Tests (default path; then each opt-in engine):

    flock /tmp/fpq-bench.lock -c 'docker run --rm --shm-size=3g fpq-merged tests.sh'
    flock /tmp/fpq-bench.lock -c 'docker run --rm --shm-size=3g -e FASTPOSTGRES_TRANSPORT=eventfd fpq-merged tests.sh'
    flock /tmp/fpq-bench.lock -c 'docker run --rm --shm-size=3g -e FASTPOSTGRES_MEMFD=1 fpq-merged tests.sh'

A/B, one at a time, under the lock, same command and harness:

    flock /tmp/fpq-bench.lock -c 'docker run --rm --shm-size=3g -e BENCH_GIT_REV=baseline fpq-baseline benchmarks.sh 100000'
    flock /tmp/fpq-bench.lock -c 'docker run --rm --shm-size=3g -e BENCH_GIT_REV=merged fpq-merged benchmarks.sh 100000'
    flock /tmp/fpq-bench.lock -c 'docker run --rm --shm-size=3g -e BENCH_GIT_REV=baseline fpq-baseline benchmarks.sh 1000000'
    flock /tmp/fpq-bench.lock -c 'docker run --rm --shm-size=3g -e BENCH_GIT_REV=merged fpq-merged benchmarks.sh 1000000'

The two fast paths on the merged image:

    flock /tmp/fpq-bench.lock -c 'docker run --rm --shm-size=3g -e BENCH_GIT_REV=merged fpq-merged python3 /src/bench/jobs/columnar_scan.py 100000'
    flock /tmp/fpq-bench.lock -c 'docker run --rm --shm-size=3g -e BENCH_GIT_REV=merged fpq-merged python3 /src/bench/orm/materialize_bench.py 100000 3'

`fpq-baseline` is the untouched `main@7e3d2e6` image already in the lab;
`fpq-merged` is this tree.

