columnar.reduce.faults: 0 0
columnar.scan.checksum: 18348572660784856466

Columnar scan 127.34M rows/s against a heap aggregate at 8.93M (+14.3×), and
the mapped reduce at 79.89M rows/s (+8.9×); `verify.reduce: ok`. The mapped
bytes are 3.88 MB, 0.507× the heap relation.

